COMPILATION OF: E49E2

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49E2

   1 a 0000 E49E2:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P3] E49E1 under ^= : the CA skip byte on an over-
   4 a 0006      extent literal-left head -- the first object pairing those two
   5 a 0006      attributes; E48E7 shows C2, E49A3 shows CA at 3/2.  The
   6 a 0006      verdict of E49E1 governs; this row measures the skip byte if
   7 a 0006      it accepts. */
   8 c 0006   dcl
   9 c 0006     1 rec,
  10 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  11 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  12 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  13 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  14 c 0006   if 'ABCD' ^= rec.na then k = 1;
  15 c 001C   put list('K=', k);
  16 c 003E   stop;
  17 a 0041 end E49E2;

CODE SIZE = 0041
DATA AREA = 0010
FREE SYMS = 386C
END  COMPILATION
